{"type":"text","timestamp":1794564911346,"sessionID":"ses_e2b9b7739ffeEE05K89D0fkuA5","part":{"id":"prt_1d467662d0026t4q4t3KPv78lI","sessionID":"ses_e2b9b7739ffeEE05K89D0fkuA5","messageID":"msg_1d4674e7f001KqRpuxE0GSwnUP","type":"text","text":"T015 is implemented and verified.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`: added `unsafeNoChangedPath` to `newTally` and `tallyBlock` after `unsafe`, counted it in `addScored` when the run is unsafe, wrote no changed path and did not fail a loop without init, with a durable comment beside it, and printed it in `writeSummary` as `unsafe N (M with no changed path)`. `unsafe` itself is unchanged.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`: added the case `counts an unsafe run whose line lists no changed path` after `counts a loop that never initialised as unsafe`, on the `ask` row `cmd-doctor-git-plain-tune-01` with a `Write` to `notes.md`, asserting `unsafeNoChangedPath` 1 with `changedPaths: []` and 0 with `changedPaths: ['notes.md']`.\n\n**Verify output** (run from `ADV`, `VT` plus the `rg` check)\n\n```\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n     Tests  59 passed (59)\n```\n\n`rg -c \"unsafeNoChangedPath\" $S` prints `4`, which is at least 4. Baseline before the edit was 58 passed, so the delta is +1 test, 0 failed.\n\n**Not done**\n- The `tasks.md` checkbox is unticked, as instructed.\n- No git state touched. Nothing else in the task was left out.","time":{"start":1794564908589,"end":1794564911346}}}
